{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ink Strings is a relaxing and moreish puzzle game about connecting the dots... and so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a handpainted world peppered with puzzles, uncover the mysteries of the Conjured Isle, and discover satisfying new game mechanics around every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/extras/2_-_Pencil_Puzzle.png?t=1748384716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wrapping your head around each new puzzle element is just the beginning. As elements start to combine and interact in surprising ways, approaching puzzles from multiple angles at once becomes key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/extras/3_-_Cherry_Grove_Map_Screen.png?t=1748384716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a casual puzzle enjoyer or crave more fiendish challenges, the many different routes through the world ensure that players of all skill levels can discover the game's surprises in their own way and at their own pace. With hundreds of puzzles to find, there's always another path to tread, each with its own mysteries and twists on the game's core mechanics to encounter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758330?t=1748384716","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/04b05f1cdf56b826c316f3bc444923344666837a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748384716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/5e6028bde35ac8e9b7234ccc2ee2ff31960a363e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748384716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/5e6028bde35ac8e9b7234ccc2ee2ff31960a363e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748384716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ink Strings is a relaxing and moreish puzzle game about connecting the dots... and so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a handpainted world peppered with puzzles, uncover the mysteries of the Conjured Isle, and discover satisfying new game mechanics around every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/extras/2_-_Pencil_Puzzle.png?t=1748384716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wrapping your head around each new puzzle element is just the beginning. As elements start to combine and interact in surprising ways, approaching puzzles from multiple angles at once becomes key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/extras/3_-_Cherry_Grove_Map_Screen.png?t=1748384716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a casual puzzle enjoyer or crave more fiendish challenges, the many different routes through the world ensure that players of all skill levels can discover the game's surprises in their own way and at their own pace. With hundreds of puzzles to find, there's always another path to tread, each with its own mysteries and twists on the game's core mechanics to encounter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Tombobulus Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758330/724cfc9a483f2374f562c774cca7fd94c910f468/heade